# Branch peer review

When the user asks to review **another developer’s branch/PR/task** (or `/review-branch`):

1. Read `.agents/skills/branch-peer-review/SKILL.md`.
2. Follow `.github/prompts/review-branch.prompt.md`.
3. Human copy-paste prompt: `docs/prompts/branch-peer-review.md`.
4. Comment blocks: `.agents/skills/pr-review-comments/SKILL.md`.

This is **not** Stage 8 `/review-staged` (own staged diff + commit gate).
